recipe filletBuri
  %1 = fillet3(fish) : (Buri<back>, Buri<collar>, Buri<frame>)
menu dinner
  %1 = buy Buri 3000 g : Buri 3000 g
  %2 = make filletBuri(fish: %1) : (Buri<back> 0..3000 g, Buri<collar> 0..3000 g, Buri<frame> 0..3000 g)
  %3 = cut(%2.1, style: slice) : Buri<back, shape: cut(slice, 3 mm)> 0..3000 g
  %4 = store(%2.2)
  %5 = discard(%2.3)
result ok errors=0 warnings=0 infos=0
exit 0
